=== 2D SCREEN BUFFER [80x24] ===
--- TEXT MATRIX ---
00: |   Pigasus CLI Changelog                                                        |
01: |                                                                                |
02: |  The terminal-first surface to interact with Pigasus agents. Stay in your flow |
03: |without context switching.                                                      |
04: |                                                                                |
05: |  ## 1.5.14                                                                     |
06: |                                                                                |
07: |  • Added /thinking (/thinking [on|off], saved as "showThinking" in             |
08: |  settings.json and off by default) to stream the model's full thinking live    |
09: |  in the transcript while it thinks and keep finished thoughts expanded         |
10: |  without pressing Ctrl+O.                                                      |
11: |  • Added a live Overview section to /swarm board on terminals at least 28      |
12: |  rows tall, showing the swarm's goal, overall task progress (Overview · N of   |
13: |  M tasks done and any blocked count), and up to six workstream threads with    |
14: |  status indicators for which workers are working, in review, waiting on a      |
15: |  peer, failed, or done.                                                        |
16: |  • Added plan mode to --remote-agent sessions, so a remote agent can research  |
17: |  and write a plan for your review before editing files or running commands:    |
18: |  switch to it with Shift+Tab, start in it with --mode plan, or choose plan     |
19: |  under Agent Mode on the Remote Agent tab of /config.                          |
20: |  • Added an Agent Mode setting (default, accept-edits, and plan) to the        |
21: |  (0–20 of 4241 lines)                                                          |
22: |                                                                                |
23: |  ↑/↓ Navigate · esc Cancel                                                     |
